If your goal is to store the entire application code inside a Docker image, place the Dockerfile in the repository root and copy all files during the build.

Dockerfile (Tomcat WAR Deployment)


FROM tomcat:9.0
 
WORKDIR /usr/local/tomcat/webapps
 
COPY target/*.war ROOT.war
 
EXPOSE 8080
 
CMD ["catalina.sh", "run"]
Build:



mvn clean package


docker build -t hyarel78/java-webapp:v1 .
Run:



docker run -d -p 8080:8080 --name webapp hyarel78/java-webapp:v1
